# Mapbox access token used by the map visualization (Map tab + water-body detail).
# Create a free public token at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/ and
# copy it here. Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables into the app at build time.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in your token. Without a
# token the app still works — the map area shows a friendly "Map unavailable"
# message and every water body remains browsable from the Nearby/Explore tabs.
EXPO_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
